Subject: [PATCH] HWUI: select the host Ganesh pipeline and GPU bitmap support

Select ArtzigGpuPipeline for host OpenGL rendering through stock Android
surfaces and HardwareBuffer targets. Keep GPU-backed hardware bitmap allocation,
render-thread uploads/readback and live Ganesh DeviceInfo initialization.
The session presenter owns Wayland; no RenderProxy or CanvasContext host-surface
entry point is needed. Report concrete resource chunk types in LoadedArsc.

